{
    "title": "LiveWell with Advocate Aurora",
    "description": "Get all your health info in one convenient place.\r\n\r\nWith our new LiveWell with Advocate Aurora Health app, you can manage your health and wellness \u2013 as well as everyone who counts on you.\r\n\r\nWith LiveWell, you can:\r\n\u2022 Start a video visit or e-visit to get a fast diagnosis and treatment plan\r\n\u2022 Manage care for yourself and everyone who counts on you all in one place\r\n\u2022 Schedule appointments and get medications for everyone who depends on you\r\n\u2022 Message your providers\r\n\u2022 Get bill notifications\r\n\u2022 Take health quizzes\r\n\u2022 Get the latest health and wellness insights\r\n\u2022 Live mindfully with guided meditation exercises\r\n\u2022 Upload health and fitness data, including data from the Apple Health app, when enrolled in self-tracking programs",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get all your health info in one convenient place.<br><br>With our new LiveWell with Advocate Aurora Health app, you can manage your health and wellness \u2013 as well as everyone who counts on you.<br><br>With LiveWell, you can:<br>\u2022 Start a video visit or e-visit to get a fast diagnosis and treatment plan<br>\u2022 Manage care for yourself and everyone who counts on you all in one place<br>\u2022 Schedule appointments and get medications for everyone who depends on you<br>\u2022 Message your providers<br>\u2022 Get bill notifications<br>\u2022 Take health quizzes<br>\u2022 Get the latest health and wellness insights<br>\u2022 Live mindfully with guided meditation exercises<br>\u2022 Upload health and fitness data, including data from the Apple Health app, when enrolled in self-tracking programs",
